{
  "message": "Your “Sprint 2” devlog reports a second island and reef damage, but no build or test records were shown. The reference tasks are complete, but playable progress remains unknown and the goal stays at risk. For the second half, replace the trailer storyboard with a rough playable slice, planning around Alex’s remaining 20–30 hours. We’ll meet after the next sprint; I look forward to your playable build, devlogs and testing notes ;)",
  "agreed": [
    {
      "text": "Replace the trailer storyboard with a downloadable build showing two rough islands, the tide loop and two-player sailing. Include launch instructions and controls.",
      "itemId": "cmvu474xb00k5k9z8pgq871bc",
      "dueDay": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Test that build with five players before day 28. Keep shared notes on whether they could sail together and understand the tide loop.",
      "itemId": null,
      "dueDay": null
    }
  ]
}

